In case anyone is interested, I've updated my Nethack Screen Saver to
avoid burn in.  Every 5 minutes, the screen shifts a small random
amount to the left or right.

If you're interested in this update, or trying it out for the first
time, head on over to:

http://drop.io/NethackScreenSaver

... and download the version with the biggest number at the end
(1002).

By the way, the screensaver is all free and the source is available
(compiled under Visual C# 2008 Express Edition (which is also free)).
I've spent time commenting the code, so if you're a newbie programmer,
you might find it educational (mostly likely on what NOT to do, but
whatever.  :)

I love hearing comments, questions, suggestions, so feel free to post
or email.  I've also put a PayPal "donation" link in the configuration
box, so if you're so inclined, throw me a buck or two.  I don't
honestly expect to get any donations, but it's really more of an
